title: "TerraTrend: NASA Earth System Trend Discovery & Intelligence Platform"
abstract: "An open-source scientific intelligence platform for detecting, quantifying, statistically testing, and explaining historical Earth-system climate trends using official NASA MERRA-2 and CERES reanalysis data."
